  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>Torchbearers carry a light sources for seasoned explorers and serve as apprentices.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The world is a wide, open place fraught with peril and adventure. Explorers use their knowledge of nature and survival skills to see every corner of the land.</p>",
